 "notes": "Source: Linn County Election Services official 'November 3, 2026 General Election - Candidate Listing' PDF (timestamp 10/7/2026 10:20:15 AM) hosted on gis.linncountyiowa.gov; parties verified by row position in the PDF. Supervisors are elected by district - voters see only their district (Districts 1 and 2 up in 2026). Township offices are vote-for-one; townships listed with 'No Candidate' have empty candidate arrays. Marked partial: www.linncountyiowa.gov (CivicPlus) returns 403 'you have been blocked' to curl, so the Public Measure text PDF and sample ballots could not be read, and Firecrawl credits ran out before the page could be scraped. The only measure recorded is the Kirkwood Community College bond, whose official text names Linn County; its wording is taken from Louisa County's official election notice (same district-wide measure). Other Linn-only measures (city/school/LOST) may exist and are NOT captured. Tried: https://www.linncountyiowa.gov/, https://www.linncountyiowa.gov/1794/November-3-2026-General-Election, https://www.linncountyiowa.gov/157/Election-Services, https://www.linncountyelections.org/lookup, guessed gis.linncountyiowa.gov measure PDF names (404)."
